From: steamac <steamac@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Log shader source and compute memory context after pipeline failures

STEAMAC-57 has no shader or workgroup context; STEAMAC-41 and R retain
only stage interfaces after a Metal ICE or compiler-service interruption.
Borrow already-cached compressed libraries during pipeline construction
and decompress only on failure. Log bounded numbered source (without
helper templates), source size, and threadgroup declarations, plus compute
entry/hash/workgroup and the actual Metal shared-memory limit.

